                                            "The genitalia, especially of a male."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang",
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "213cfdd9-fc9d-4eba-a130-89bf4c4a8e31",
                                                "sense_id": "8d9e601c-9738-379f-888a-dec326c0b07b",
                                                "text": "I'm talking about everybody getting crunk, crunk / Boys tryin' to touch my junk, junk / Gonna smack him if he getting too drunk, drunk"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bac4fd9-31ae-4f15-ac16-6d721840c3a8",
                                                "sense_id": "8d9e601c-9738-379f-888a-dec326c0b07b",
                                                "text": "But what to do about a kid who flashes his privates at your child? And worse, how do you make sure your kid does not reciprocate? That's exactly the dilemma one mom faced when she learned that her 5-year-old neighbor had flashed his \"junk\" at her two sons and then made them swear not to tell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fb3f9eae-5c7b-4bfd-882d-980f66c31b5b",
                                                "sense_id": "8d9e601c-9738-379f-888a-dec326c0b07b",
                                                "text": "Got a spot on the voice, I'm a neo punk / Old ladies cum when I flash my junk"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "86a6e256-a637-3d60-825a-f5932544ee5a",
                                        "entry_id": "fd065974-0c0b-3eb0-a514-558718ba13e4",
                                        "glosses": [
